  "body": ">  If struct’s item-in-shadow-tree is false, then set global’s current event to event.\r\n\r\nStep 2.8.2 of \"[inner invoke](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/#ref-for-event-path-item-in-shadow-tree%E2%91%A0)\" contains a reference to \"struct’s\" which doesn't seem to be defined within the algorithm. The earlier \"invoke\" algorithm is given a struct, but it's not clear whether it's passed to \"inner invoke\".",
